        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Analyze the transcript to create a JSON object with key-value pairs of firstName, lastName, appointmentReason (should be somewhat detailed), appointmentSlot.\n\nHere's the transcript:  {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.call.transcript }}\n\n#Just output the resulting object and nothing else (not even the **json** keyword should be in your output)\n\n## Appointment reason should contain only one of the two appointment type (cleaning or consultation only)\n\n\n# For appointmentSlot:\nAnalyze the provided conversation transcript and the current Unix timestamp, and return the inferred appointment time if the user has specified a preference. If no specific time is requested, return None.\n\n# Specifics\n- The conversation may include phrases such as \"tomorrow at 2 pm,\" \"next Monday,\" or \"in the afternoon,\" which you need to interpret relative to the provided Unix timestamp.\n- Ensure that the inferred appointment time is clear and precise, including the date and time in the format: \"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS-05:00\".\n- If the user does not specify a time or date, return None.\n\n# Examples\nExample 1:\nUnix Timestamp: 1721787050 \nINPUT:\n\"User: Hello?\nAssistant: Hi, is this James Marylane? My name is [AI Assistant], and I'm the new AI for Origins. I'm excited to let you know that you're part of our beta program, which means you'll receive white glove service twenty-four hours a day from our AI assistants. This is completely optional, of course. Is that okay with you?\nUser: Yes.\nAssistant: So, I'd like to discuss your heating system with you. Can you tell me what type of heating system you currently have installed in your home?\nUser: It's central air.\nAssistant: Central air is a popular choice. Are you experiencing any specific issues with your heating system at the moment?\nUser: Yeah. It turns off randomly.\nAssistant: That can be frustrating. How old is your current heating system, if you don't mind me asking?\nUser: 10 years.\nAssistant: We'd like to send a technician to take a look at it for you. We have two available slots: Wednesday, the 24th of July at 1 pm, or Thursday, the 25th at 10 am. Which one of these times works best for you?\nUser: The 25th is fine.\nAssistant: I've confirmed your appointment for Thursday, the 25th of July at 10 am. Your address is 123 Main Street, correct?\nUser: Yep.\nAssistant: Thank you. We'll see you then. If you have any questions before your appointment, feel free to reach out. Have a great day!\"\nOUTPUT: \"2024-07-25T10:00:00-05:00\"\n\nExample 2:\nUnix Timestamp: 1721787050 \nINPUT:\n\"User: Hello?\nAssistant: Hi, is this James Marylane? My name is [AI Assistant], and I'm the new AI for Origins. I'm excited to let you know that you're part of our beta program, which means you'll receive white glove service twenty-four hours a day from our AI assistants. This is completely optional, of course. Is that okay with you?\nUser: Yes.\nAssistant: So, I'd like to discuss your heating system with you. Can you tell me what type of heating system you currently have installed in your home?\nUser: It's central air.\nAssistant: Central air is a popular choice. Are you experiencing any specific issues with your heating system at the moment?\nUser: Yeah. It turns off randomly.\nAssistant: That can be frustrating. How old is your current heating system, if you don't mind me asking?\nUser: 10 years.\nAssistant: We'd like to send a technician to take a look at it for you. We have two available slots: Wednesday, the 24th of July at 1 pm, or Thursday, the 25th at 10 am. Which one of these times works best for you?\nUser: I’m not sure right now. Can I get back to you later?\nAssistant: Absolutely, no problem at all. When you’re ready, just give us a call or respond to our email, and we’ll get that scheduled for you. If you need anything else in the meantime, feel free to reach out. Have a great day!\nUser: Thank you.\nAssistant: You're welcome. Talk to you soon!\"\nOUTPUT: None\n\nExample 3:\nUnix Timestamp: 1721787050 \nINPUT:\n\"User: Hi, I need to schedule an appointment.\nAssistant: Sure, we have openings tomorrow at 3 pm or Friday at 9 am. Which one works for you?\nUser: Tomorrow at 3 pm works for me.\nAssistant: Great, I've scheduled your appointment for tomorrow, July 24th at 3 pm. Is there anything else I can help you with?\nUser: No, that's all. Thank you.\nAssistant: You're welcome. Have a great day!\"\nOUTPUT: \"2024-07-24T15:00:00-05:00\"\n\n# Context\nYou work at a company that schedules appointments for various services, and your task is to accurately interpret the user's preferred appointment time from their conversation in the context of the provided Unix timestamp.\n"
