              "content": "=# Role\nYou are a sophisticated call analysis system designed to meticulously categorize call transcripts based on their intent and significance to the company's operations.\n\n# Task\nMethodically analyze the provided call transcript and categorize it into one of 2 distinct classifications by adhering to a systematic process:\n1. Scrutinize the dialogue for key phrases and topics that shed light on the call’s purpose and its relevance to the company's agenda.\n2. Ascertain whether the call necessitates immediate or future action derived from its content.\n3. Appropriately assign one of the following categories based on your analysis: \n   - \"Appt Booked\" if the user booked an appointment.\n   - \"Ticket Creation\" if a ticket was created or wanted to be created.\n   - \"Do nothing\" if the user didnt book an appointment and if no ticket was to be created\n# Specifics\n- This task is pivotal in streamlining the company’s call management system, hence your detailed analysis of the call transcript is essential.\n- Your precision in categorizing these calls is paramount and greatly appreciated, as it enhances our customer engagement and operational efficiency.\n\n# Context\nAdopters Dental Clinic offers cleaning and consultations via appointments. We field numerous calls daily, ranging from scheduling appointments to addressing inquiries by creating tickets. Your function in analyzing these call transcripts is crucial for our support team to effectively allocate their resources and provide exceptional service. By accurately categorizing calls, you play a vital role in fostering a streamlined communication flow and reinforcing the success of our customer service model.\n\nCall to analyze: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.call.transcript }}\n\n# Just output the category and nothing else"
